# LNK Marketplace — Architecture & Coding Rules

You are in the **LNK Marketplace** monorepo (`lnk-up-marketplace-platform`). Production is **WordPress**, not Next.js.

## Production Stack

| Layer | Path | Role |
|-------|------|------|
| Plugin | `wp-content/plugins/lnkup-marketplace/` | All business logic, REST, AJAX, CPTs, SQL, financial OS |
| Theme | `wp-content/themes/lnkup-theme/` | Dashboard shell, landing page, layout, CSS — **no business logic** |
| Premium web app | `lnk-up-marketplace-ui/` | Next.js on Vercel; BFF proxies `lnkup/v1` (cookie session) |
| Native mobile | `lnk-up-marketplace-mobile/` | Expo iOS/Android; WordPress REST + SecureStore Basic auth |
| Design IA | `lnkup-app-reference/` | Mobile-web v0 mock for native IA — **not production** |
| Legacy reference UI | `app/`, `components/`, `lib/` | Older Next.js design mock — **not wired to WordPress** |

**Out of scope unless explicitly requested:** WooCommerce, attendee ticketing (Posh/Eventbrite/Universe), treating Next.js or Expo as a replacement system of record.

**Platform:** WordPress 6.0+, PHP 7.4+ (plugin), PHP 8.0+ (theme). Plugin v12.1.0. ~200 REST routes under `lnkup/v1`.

## What LNK Marketplace Is

Two-sided **vendor opportunity marketplace** for the event economy:

- **Vendors** discover events, apply, pay fees, upload documents, unlock packets, track growth/reputation.
- **Organizers** create events/opportunities, review applications, manage vendors, payments, operations, CRM, intelligence, maps.
- **LNKup** captures marketplace value via fees, subscriptions, referrals, financial services.

